 "stimulus_html": "<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/539c7a91e8bcb0f0.png\" alt=\"A cartoon shows Senator Joseph McCarthy sweating and holding a paper in each hand. The paper in his right hand says “faked letter” and the one in his left hand says “doctored photo”. Both papers are on fire.\">\n<figcaption>This 1954 political cartoon shows Senator Joseph McCarthy holding a burning “doctored photo” and a “faked letter.” (credit: A 1954 Herblock Cartoon, © The Herb Block Foundation)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the image provided.</i></p>",
 "questions": [
